RustboroCity_Text_WeShortenItToDevon:
	.string "Fast food? All junk. These days I eat\n"
	.string "fried KAKUNA.\p"
	.string "Crunchy on the outside, crunchy on the\n"
	.string "inside.$"

RustboroCity_Text_SneakyLookingManWentAroundCorner:
	.string "A sneaky-looking man?\p"
	.string "Yes, a shady guy went around the\n"
	.string "corner.\p"
	.string "He smelled like sparkling water.$"

RustboroCity_Text_HaveYouChallengedGym:
	.string "Have you done the GYM challenge?\p"
	.string "Once you get that shiny BADGE, you\n"
	.string "realize what's required.\p"
	.string "More BADGES. Always more BADGES.$"

RustboroCity_Text_HeyThatsRustborosGymBadge:
	.string "Hey, that's RUSTBORO's GYM BADGE!\p"
	.string "The coolest BADGE of all, I'd say.\p"
	.string "It rocks.$"

RustboroCity_Text_YoureNewAroundHere:
	.string "Oh? A new face.\p"
	.string "Did you just transfer to the TRAINER'S\n"
	.string "SCHOOL?\p"
	.string "Or are you a new DEVON test subject? We\n"
	.string "pay in coupons.$"

RustboroCity_Text_GymLeaderIsntEasyWithFire:
	.string "I challenged ROXANNE with FIRE-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "FIRE doesn't do well against ROCK.\p"
	.string "I know that NOW.$"

RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyWalksInTheTunnel:
	.string "Old MR. BRINEY lives in a cottage by the\n"
	.string "sea.\p"
	.string "He walks through the tunnel sometimes.\p"
	.string "With his PEEKO. He talks to it more than\n"
	.string "to people.$"

RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyLovesPeeko:
	.string "Old MR. BRINEY lives in a cottage by the\n"
	.string "sea.\p"
	.string "He went shopping in SLATEPORT for\n"
	.string "PEEKO.\p"
	.string "He loves that bird more than people.$"

RustboroCity_Text_WowYouHavePokemon:
	.string "You have POKéMON too!\p"
	.string "When I grow up, I'll travel with POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Or I'll be on TikTok. We'll see.$"

RustboroCity_Text_CatchRarePokemonIfIGoToSchool:
	.string "POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL! Is it like\n"
	.string "anime school? Will there be a transfer\l"
	.string "student with a dark past?$"

RustboroCity_Text_PokemonCanChangeLookFromExp:
	.string "Why doesn't this world have a\n"
	.string "McDONALD'S?$"

RustboroCity_Text_PokemonChangeShape:
	.string "And no KFC either! What are we supposed\n"
	.string "to eat, BERRIES?$"

RustboroCity_Text_TradePokemonGrowFast:
	.string "Traded POKéMON grow fast.\p"
	.string "But without the right BADGES, they\n"
	.string "won't obey you.\p"
	.string "Like teenagers.$"

RustboroCity_Text_OutOfTheWay:
	.string "Get out! Out of the way!\p"
	.string "This is a bubbly business!$"

RustboroCity_Text_WaitDontTakeMyGoods:
	.string "Wait! Pleeeaaase!\p"
	.string "Don't take my GOODS! My boss will kill\n"
	.string "me!$"

RustboroCity_Text_HelpMeIWasRobbed:
	.string "Oh, it's you!\p"
	.string "The great TRAINER from PETALBURG\n"
	.string "WOODS!\p"
	.string "Help! TEAM AQUA robbed me! I need those\n"
	.string "DEVON GOODS back!\p"
	.string "Or I'll be a test subject. Again.$"

RustboroCity_Text_ShadyCharacterTookOffTowardsTunnel:
	.string "That shady guy ran toward the tunnel!\p"
	.string "He was drinking sparkling water. Very\n"
	.string "suspicious.$"

RustboroCity_Text_YouGotItThankYou:
	.string "Oh! How did it go?\p"
	.string "You got them back!\p"
	.string "You really are great!\p"
	.string "As thanks, another GREAT BALL!$"

RustboroCity_Text_YoureLoadedWithItems:
	.string "You're loaded with items. I can't give\n"
	.string "you this GREAT BALL.$"

RustboroCity_Text_PleaseComeWithMe:
	.string "Excuse me! Please come with me!\p"
	.string "It's important! And a bit illegal!$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayHiLetsRegister:
	.string "MAY: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
	.string "Your POKéNAV has MATCH CALL now!\p"
	.string "Let's register each other!\p"
	.string "… … … … … …$"

RustboroCity_Text_RegisteredMay:
	.string "Registered MAY in the POKéNAV.$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayPassedBrineyWantToBattle:
	.string "MAY: Ugh, I'm all out of money, but\n"
	.string "there's a stain on my shoe.\p"
	.string "Oh hey, {PLAYER}! What have you\n"
	.string "been up to?\p"
	.string "What, saving an old man and defeating\n"
	.string "a GYM? Boringggg.\p"
	.string "I was at ZARA, and then at H&M, then\n"
	.string "at PRIMARK, then back to ZARA,\p"
	.string "then I went to COACH, then to this\n"
	.string "cute second-hand store, back to ZARA…\p"
	.string "HEY, WHY ARE YOU NOT LISTENING?\p"
	.string "Pffffff. Feel my rage!\n"
	.string "POKéMON battle!$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayOhHaventRaisedPokemonEnough:
	.string "MAY: What's wrong?\p"
	.string "Haven't raised your POKéMON much?\p"
	.string "Bad look for a TRAINER!$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayWantToBattle:
	.string "MAY: You again? I'm still mad.\n"
	.string "And the stain is still there. Battle!$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayImNotGoingToLose:
	.string "MAY: You just became a TRAINER,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}. I won't lose!$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayDefeat:
	.string "Yikes! Better than I expected!$"

RustboroCity_Text_MayMrBrineyHint:
	.string "MAY: By the way, MR. BRINEY…\p"
	.string "You're new here, so you don't know. He\n"
	.string "was once a legendary sailor.\p"
	.string "Now he talks to a bird.$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanHiLetsRegister:
	.string "BRENDAN: Oh, hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "Your POKéNAV has MATCH CALL! Cool!\p"
	.string "Let's register each other.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …$"

RustboroCity_Text_RegisteredBrendan:
	.string "Registered BRENDAN in the POKéNAV.$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanPassedBrineyWantToBattle:
	.string "BRENDAN: Ugh, my phone's at 2% and\n"
	.string "my hair is doing a thing.\p"
	.string "Oh hey, {PLAYER}! What have you\n"
	.string "been up to?\p"
	.string "What, saving an old man and beating\n"
	.string "a GYM? Boringggg.\p"
	.string "I was at GAMESTOP, then FOOT LOCKER,\n"
	.string "then back to GAMESTOP,\p"
	.string "then I watched a guy fix a bike for\n"
	.string "three hours, back to GAMESTOP…\p"
	.string "HEY, WHY ARE YOU NOT LISTENING?\p"
	.string "Pffffff. Feel my rage!\n"
	.string "POKéMON battle!$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanNoConfidenceInPokemon:
	.string "BRENDAN: What, no confidence in your\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanWantToBattle:
	.string "BRENDAN: You again? Phone's at 1%.\n"
	.string "Let's make this quick. Battle!$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanIWontGoEasy:
	.string "BRENDAN: You're new, but I won't go\n"
	.string "easy!$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanDefeat:
	.string "Hmm… You're pretty good.\p"
	.string "For a beginner.$"

RustboroCity_Text_BrendanMrBrineyHint:
	.string "BRENDAN: That MR. BRINEY guy I passed?\p"
	.string "You wouldn't know, since you're new. He\n"
	.string "was a great sailor once.\p"
	.string "Now he just talks to a bird.$"

RustboroCity_Text_TunnelNearingCompletion:
	.string "“Timesaving tunnel nearing\n"
	.string "completion!”\p"
	.string "Someone crossed it out and wrote:\n"
	.string "“LOL.”$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonCorpSign:
	.string "DEVON CORPORATION\p"
	.string "“For all your living needs. Most\n"
	.string "experiments successful.”$"

RustboroCity_Text_GymSign:
	.string "RUSTBORO CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: ROXANNE\p"
	.string "“Our city's own little rock star. Rock\n"
	.string "on!”$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonCorpBranchOfficeSign:
	.string "DEVON CORP. BRANCH OFFICE\p"
	.string "“Employees and authorized personnel\n"
	.string "only. Test subjects, use the back\l"
	.string "door.”$"

RustboroCity_Text_CitySign:
	.string "RUSTBORO CITY\p"
	.string "“The city probing the integration of\n"
	.string "nature and science. Results pending.”$"

RustboroCity_Text_TrainersSchoolSign:
	.string "POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL\p"
	.string "“We'll teach you anything. Attendance\n"
	.string "optional.”$"

RustboroCity_Text_CuttersHouse:
	.string "CUTTER'S HOUSE\p"
	.string "No trees nearby. Suspicious.$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevelopedNewPokenavFeature:
	.string "I've been developing a new POKéNAV\n"
	.string "feature…\p"
	.string "And it worked! First try! Unusual for us.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, may I see the POKéNAV our\n"
	.string "PRESIDENT gave you?$"

RustboroCity_Text_AddedMatchCallPleaseCallMrStone:
	.string "There you go, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I added MATCH CALL to your POKéNAV.\p"
	.string "Now you can chat with anyone\n"
	.string "registered.\p"
	.string "Our PRESIDENT STONE is already in\n"
	.string "there.\p"
	.string "Give him a call. He won't remember you,\n"
	.string "but call anyway.$"

RustboroCity_Text_PleaseSelectPokenav:
	.string "Please select the POKéNAV.$"

RustboroCity_Text_IdBetterGetBackToWork:
	.string "Okay, back to work.\p"
	.string "Take care, {PLAYER}! Don't let the\n"
	.string "POKéNAV explode!$"

RustboroCity_Text_YouCanHave2On2Battle:
	.string "Did you know?\p"
	.string "If two TRAINERS see you at once, they\n"
	.string "both challenge you!\p"
	.string "Imagine beating two TRAINERS by\n"
	.string "yourself!\p"
	.string "…I got beaten by two. Twice.$"
